---
import { site } from "../../data/site";
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="content-section intro-section"
  aria-labelledby="about-title"
>
  <div class="section-kicker">
    <span class="kicker-index">01 / Introduction</span><span class="kicker-rule"
    ></span><span>Guangzhou, China</span>
  </div>
  <p class="intro-hello">Hello, I'm Jinghe <span aria-hidden="true">✳</span></p>
  <h1 id="about-title">Designing AI that feels <em>more human.</em></h1>
  <div class="intro-grid">
    <div class="intro-copy">
      <p>
        Hi, I’m Jinghe Yu, a <strong>final-year undergraduate</strong> at
        <strong>South China University of Technology (SCUT)</strong> and an
        <strong>HCI researcher</strong> working at the intersection of
        <strong
          >human-centered AI, affective computing, and multimodal interaction</strong
        >.
      </p>
      <p>
        My research explores how intelligent systems can understand not only
        what people do, but also the <strong
          >context, intention, and feeling</strong
        >
        behind it. I build and evaluate interactive systems that turn emotion into
        adaptive typography, sound into material sensation, and fluid ideas into tangible
        forms for AI-assisted sensemaking and collaborative writing.
      </p>
      <p>
        I also examine whether multimodal models genuinely understand affect or
        merely rely on convenient cues.
      </p>
      <p class="intro-manifesto">
        I want to create AI that <strong
          >works with people in the messiness of everyday life</strong
        >, not just models that perform well on benchmarks.
      </p>
      <nav class="intro-explorations" aria-label="Explore research examples">
        <span class="intro-explorations-label">Explore the ideas</span>
        <a href="#emotype26"
          ><span>Emotion</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><strong
            >Typography</strong
          ></a
        >
        <a href="#touchsound26"
          ><span>Sound</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><strong
            >Sensation</strong
          ></a
        >
        <a href="#liqo"
          ><span>Ideas</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><strong
            >Form</strong
          ></a
        >
      </nav>
      <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}
        >Research collaborations are welcome <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span
        ></a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="intro-aside">
      <span class="aside-star" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
      <span class="aside-label">At a glance</span>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Focus</dt><dd>Human-centered AI</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Based at</dt><dd>SCUT · Guangzhou</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Next chapter</dt><dd>PhD · Fall 2027</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
